{"id":"wb-4-218","name":"硇州灯塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"硇洲灯塔","text":"硇（náo）洲灯塔，是位于中国广东省湛江市硇洲岛上的一座灯塔，始建于清光绪二十五年（1899年），是目前世界上仅存的两座水晶磨镜灯塔之一，1996年公布为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A1%87%E6%B4%B2%E7%81%AF%E5%A1%94","revisionId":94700402,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94700402","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核名称、所在地与对应遗址；原名录行政地址及参考点位不作为唯一判断依据","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4fdfcc7ba2b9ea63836e6d4f.jpg","title":"Naozhou_Lighthouse_-_P1580068.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Naozhou_Lighthouse_-_P1580068.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6d/Naozhou_Lighthouse_-_P1580068.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"User:Vmenkov","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​硇洲岛灯塔","width":320,"height":240,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图","subject":"硇洲灯塔"}}